    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Assumptions (JAW-9962)\n- Schedule: cron `0 2 * * *` (UTC); **Outreach Gmail OAuth** on all Gmail HTTP steps (no external child workflow IDs).\n- Inline steps: prefetch spam ids → batch un-spam; list inbox (`$env.GMAIL_WARMUP_QUERY`); auto-reply send; star + archive sampled messages.\n- After steps: parent lists **SPAM** (≤50), moves to **INBOX**+**STARRED**; logs `spam_to_inbox_flagged`.\n- Logs: `warmup_action_logs`, `warmup_run_summaries`, `workflow_error_logs`; admin Gmail → `$env.ADMIN_NOTIFY_EMAIL`.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 560
      },
      "id": "9946aa11-bb22-4433-cc44-dd55ee667788",
      "name": "Assumptions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -360,
        -320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 2 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
